{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19106260","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19106260","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1910626001:1":{"text":"I am Zann, the guardian of the Wishing Tidepool.","source_cn":"我是这里的守池人，湛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FA7E639FBA88551","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910626002:1":{"text":"Call me what you like. The name has gone unused so long I have nearly forgotten it myself.","source_cn":"可以随便称呼我，这个名字太久没用，我自己都快忘了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C63C2EB769917B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910626003:1":{"text":"你们是今年最后一批，去镌刻心愿吧，愿望不论早晚。","source_cn":"你们是今年最后一批，去镌刻心愿吧，愿望不论早晚。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x33BF1519907C2896","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910626004:1":{"text":"Y-you're still here. That's incredible.","source_cn":"你……你还在，不可思议。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA638DB4F982C8008","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1910626004":{"text":"Y-you're still here. That's incredible.","source_cn":"你……你还在，不可思议。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA638DB4F982C8008","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910626005:1":{"text":"The tides ebb and flow and leave no trace behind. The reefs, however, stand eternal and hold your wishes in their mind.","source_cn":"潮升潮落，来去无痕；礁岩永伫，心愿长存。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CDC89AC030149F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910626006:1":{"text":"Once the renewal season begins, the clans of the Deepsea call a truce among themselves and take turns leaving their marks on these stone carvings. This is the only peacehold in the Deepsea. It's a tradition every clan acknowledges.","source_cn":"洄游季开始后，深海族裔之间会彼此休战，轮流在这里的石刻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB9FAFF61F67A8F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910626007:1":{"text":"Hopes for a newborn child, blessings for a life that may soon pass... things of that sort.","source_cn":"对新生儿的期待，对可能消逝的生命的祝愿……诸如此类。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54AF9CFEB2FA3E9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910626008:1":{"text":"So this is where each of you leaves a wish? All the Deepfolk, you and Garnet included?","source_cn":"所以这是……你们各自留下愿望的地方？所有深海族裔，包括...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E8099D88EB0A8FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910626009:1":{"text":"Yes.","source_cn":"对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAAE344DA30C35B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"Inscribe a wish?","source_cn":"镌刻心愿？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x111CEC43F722C6AC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Inscribe a wish?","female":"Inscribe a wish?","variant_male_record_index":"96018","variant_female_record_index":"96019","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910626010:1":{"text":"Mister I-don't-know-my-name, I am of the Shallowfolk of Coralia. Although these two are landfolk, they're also members of the Seamoon Clan.","source_cn":"不知名的先生，我是出身塔拉萨的浅海裔，这两位来自陆地，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E086DB4D8BBFCB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910626011:1":{"text":"You may not look alike on the outside, but that does not mean you're different on the inside. They come from land yet belong to the Shallowsea. You come from the Shallowsea, and you too can belong to the Deepsea.","source_cn":"你们的外表并不相像，但内里未必不同。他们来自陆地，却属...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59D5C6AF8B5CAFA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910626012:1":{"text":"嗯……是吗？好像有道理，但又好像没道理。我不想做深岩家的人，但是卡律先生愿不愿意加入海月家呢？这样歌尼特也能和小汐儿一起玩了！","source_cn":"嗯……是吗？好像有道理，但又好像没道理。我不想做深岩家...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x2DD4087AE49D2820","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910626013:1":{"text":"No.","source_cn":"不想。","status":"matched_cn_aligned_index","hash_xxh64":"0x571BE0B44E5FBB8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910626014:1":{"text":"Oh... that's a pity...","source_cn":"噢……真可惜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x542FD10745C64B6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"深岩家的新生儿？我们？","source_cn":"深岩家的新生儿？我们？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xA8DAAFBE7F0892E4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"96020","variant_female_record_index":"96021","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910626015:1":{"text":"We haven't met a single person on this whole trip that could talk straight. How come you're fine?","source_cn":"咱一路过来没见到一个能正常说话的人，你怎么没事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84B55F2684B18459","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910626016:1":{"text":"Because here, <style=\"highlight\">there's only room for one thing</style>.","source_cn":"因为这里<style=highlight>只装得下一件...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BBCDE7A816393C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910626017:1":{"text":"心愿潮池只有愿望存在，一代人的愿望，数代人的愿望。每天维护潮池，擦拭碑文，修缮被海浪侵蚀的心愿，做这些的时候，我什么也听不见。","source_cn":"心愿潮池只有愿望存在，一代人的愿望，数代人的愿望。每天...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x5A8A8A4FFBB8E226","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910626018:1":{"text":"A wish is proof that someone once existed. I protect them. Perhaps, in turn, they protect me. It's only a pity that no new wish has drifted here in a very long time.","source_cn":"心愿是人存在过的证明，我保护它们，也许它们也保护我。只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EA2C0AC987FC165","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910626019:1":{"text":"That's how you're able to stay rational?","source_cn":"所以你能保持理智？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC99130744B3B4537","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1910626020:1":{"text":"I hear the drumming as well, but I just choose not to listen.","source_cn":"鼓声正在持续，我听得到。我只是选择不去听。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EEF89CC04288BD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:2:3":{"text":"You're still in your right mind, right?","source_cn":"你还保持着理智？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x43D7682D15418F9D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You're still in your right mind, right?","female":"You're still in your right mind, right?","variant_male_record_index":"96022","variant_female_record_index":"96023","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1910626021:1":{"text":"I don't know what a Graveborn is, but I have seen a Shallowfolk.","source_cn":"我不知道什么是亡灵，但见过一个浅海裔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77D432C16F335642","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910626022:1":{"text":"He's been here many times. He swam straight here and wanted to leave a wish, so I let him pass.","source_cn":"他来过这里，许多次。他径直游来，想留刻心愿，于是我放他通行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16E7757DDCDF47F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1910626023:1":{"text":"You don't even know him, and you're helping him?!","source_cn":"你不认识他，干嘛帮他？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42578D673139D3D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1910626024:1":{"text":"This is a place where wishes gather. No one should be turned away.","source_cn":"此处是愿望齐聚之地，没人应被拒绝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA792D3086C46B556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1910626025:1":{"text":"Can we take a look at the inscriptions here?","source_cn":"先生，我们可以看看这里的刻印吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F35A6C7D6AD4C56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1910626026:1":{"text":"Go ahead. Feel free to carve your own wishes here as well.","source_cn":"请便，也欢迎刻录你们自己的心愿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC61F5B56549732D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:3:4":{"text":"Have you ever seen a Graveborn?","source_cn":"你有没有见过一个亡灵？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4E96165A204DFAAD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Have you ever seen a Graveborn?","female":"Have you ever seen a Graveborn?","variant_male_record_index":"96024","variant_female_record_index":"96025","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:守池人湛":{"text":"Zann","source":"守池人湛","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡律":{"text":"Calix","source":"卡律","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:艾菲拉":{"text":"Elphira","source":"艾菲拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:图澜":{"text":"Tolan","source":"图澜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":32,"localized_text_count":31,"speaker_count":4}}